<p>Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>

<p><%= @notification.message %></p>

<p>
  Open the task in <%= @doubtfire_product_name %> to read the request and
  grant or reject it. The reason the student gave is not included in this email.
</p>

<% if @notification.link.present? %>
  <p>
    <a href="<%= @doubtfire_host %><%= @notification.link %>">
      Open the task
    </a>
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  This notification is sent when a student asks for an extension that needs
  someone to assess it.
</p>

<p>
  You can manage your notification preferences in
  <a href="<%= @unsubscribe_url %>">your profile</a>.
</p>
